  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCD: Supporting public health action against NCDs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FHI will work with partner countries to collect data and use evidence to establish priorities for public health.  FHI will support national institutes to work across government to implement multi-sectoral action to prevent risks to health and promote well-being. 

Main partner countries are Ghana, Malawi, Palestine, Ethiopia, Nepal and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
